ists (throws ResourceNotFoundException if not)\n  - Validates shipment is not CANCELLED (throws ConflictException if it is)\n  - Transitions CREATED→CONFIRMED and persists via repository\n  - Idempotent: already CONFIRMED shipments are saved again with no side effect\n  - Returns 200 OK with the shipment body\n  - Necessary change: this is the core feature requested by the ticket\n\n- **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 4 test methods:\n  - `confirms a shipment in CREATED status and transitions to CONFIRMED` — validates the happy path\n  - `confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment and succeeds without changing state` — validates idempotency\n  - `rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with 409` — validates conflict rejection\n  - `rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404` — validates not-found rejection\n  - All necessary because acceptance criteria require \"a test that would fail against the old code\"\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements are met.\n\nNow I'll generate the completion contract.\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that idempotently moves shipments from CREATED to CONFIRMED, rejects CANCELLED with 409, and returns 404 for unknown shipments.\n\nChanged       sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt — added SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED error code to the ErrorCode enum\n              sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt — added confirm() endpoint to handle POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm\n              sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt — added 4 test cases for the confirm endpoint\n\nTests         Test: confirms a shipment in CREATED status and transitions to CONFIRMED — validates CREATED→CONFIRMED transition\n              Test: confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment and succeeds without changing state — validates idempotency requirement\n 